 "schema": 1,
 "note": "Optional companion owners. The bundle detects, plans and delegates; each owner installs, updates and heals itself. Nothing here is executed without an explicit --run on an allowlisted entrypoint. A directory only counts when its name matches the owner's repository name, so a backup or an unrelated tool that happens to contain the same marker file cannot be mistaken for that companion.",
